-## Evidence584 — Qualify translated proof-cache replay on the current reload implementation
-
-After the Native fixture pin was refreshed, Lean 4.34.1 ran one version probe and two successful compiles for the same generator-emitted fictional `True` obligation. The emitted source, receipt, content-addressed record and disk index matched. The cache reopened and reused the exact record. Changes to the artifact or proof context were refused without another Native process. The guarded Source leases, resources and parent process closed. The earlier ordinary suite passed 13 software cases across eight functions. The Native run earned zero pytest cases and covers the fictional proof-cache fixture. [Native qualification](/tmp/P1-Guide583-existing-Native2-prepared-INERT-iDXkyN/actual-Guide583-translated-proof-cache-Native2-closed.json) · [Published fixture pin](/tmp/Root-P1-Guide583-Native2-exact-current-owXwGME8/actual-code-publication-joined-to-Guide584-evidence.json) · [Ordinary software qualification](/tmp/Root-P1-cache-reload-owned-existing-route-wK9s5mUF/ordinary13-first/actual-ordinary13-qualified.json)
